  "plain": "Bobby Ray Inman, a retired admiral who once ran the National Security Agency, the US agency that listens in on foreign communications, flatly says there were never any recovered UFOs. Speaking in an interview with Jay Anderson, a man who interviews people about UFOs, sometime in the 2020s, he says: \"Absolutely were no retrieved UFOs. I have high confidence.\" Michels plays the clip on two episodes, the second time without naming the interview, as a firm denial from one of the most senior intelligence figures to be asked."
